OpenDungeons_Version:0.7.1  # The version of OpenDungeons which created this file (for compatibility reasons).

[Info]
Name	Heroes of the Deep
Description	Four keepers, and a vault in the middle that answers digging with hero waves aimed at whoever it feels like. Quarter turn symmetric. 4 players. A hero company holds 4 keeps in the wilds; storm them for their gold, or leave them be and fight whatever they send out.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

